Chapter: HalPeripheralUseAfterClose
  cites Foreword chapter Board

 Writing to a peripheral after releasing it. The close consumed the
 handle, so the later send is a second use of a spent value: CDX2061.
 This is use-after-free, at the bus.

Section: Body
  use-after-close : Integer -> [Device.Mmio] Integer
  use-after-close (base) = act
    p0 <- uart-open base default-uart-config
    r <- uart-close p0
    p1 <- uart-send p0 65
    uart-close p1
  end

  opening : Text = "uaf"
